## Desktops

**None installed by default.** Pick one after flashing:

```
armbian-config  ->  System  ->  Desktop
```

KDE Plasma runs on X11 with LightDM. Wayland is not used: on this BSP it breaks GPU
compositing and mpv. KDE keeps installing packages in background after first login; wait
ten minutes or more before judging anything missing, and do not reboot or unplug box
while it installs.

