## About this repository

Repo publishes **board bring-up sources** (device tree, overlays, kernel config, kernel
patches, board file, front-panel daemon, Bluetooth firmware, BSP files from v6.x) under
GPL-2.0, plus Armbian 8.0 groundwork: DTB overlay source and tree-diff gate, kernel
package builder, `h96-selftest` and CI. 8.0 userland package sources and kernel patch
series are not published here yet; for full feature set use pre-built release image. See
[README.md](README.md) for build steps.

